// Pilot cards (First Edition). A fleet is a list of pilots; each pilot
// implies its ship class. `cost` is ship + pilot in squad points. `source`
// lets scenarios restrict the roster (CoreSet = The Force Awakens core
// set). Abilities are data tags documented in sf-core/src/pilot.rs; each is
// enforced in the rules only once PilotAbility::implemented says so.
